WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.075
Unit 2 packages the client.

2
00:00:02.075 --> 00:00:06.440
Download it from the Global Secure
Access admin center, put it beside

3
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:11.188
Learn's installation script, and wrap
both with the Win32 Content Prep Tool.

4
00:00:11.188 --> 00:00:14.247
Learn's script sets I P
version four preferred,

5
00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:19.238
runs the installer quietly, and returns
thirty ten when a restart is needed.

6
00:00:19.238 --> 00:00:23.638
Then create the Win32 app in
Intune with Learn's values.

7
00:00:23.638 --> 00:00:26.737
The install command runs the
script through PowerShell.

8
00:00:26.737 --> 00:00:32.313
The uninstall command runs the client with
uninstall, quiet and no-restart switches.

9
00:00:32.313 --> 00:00:34.149
Install behavior is System.

10
00:00:34.149 --> 00:00:36.737
The return codes are zero for success,

11
00:00:36.737 --> 00:00:40.825
thirty ten for a soft reboot,
and sixteen eighteen for retry.

12
00:00:40.825 --> 00:00:45.750
The detection rule is the client's file,
by version, at least the packaged version.

13
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.867
And the assignment is
Required, to the pilot group,

14
00:00:48.867 --> 00:00:51.360
with the restart grace period enabled.
